    "offload_to_b": "B computes the 19-bit attack/release music envelope from transmitted post-mix PCM; AV2 headers carry the eight-bit target within the existing 291-word CRC-protected metadata packet. A publishes only after the matching PCM playback position.",
    "receive_buffer": "A/B control UART consumers use payload only on the verified receive pulse; the duplicate published-payload register bank is removed.",
